1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
You're sending me away to Saga?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
That's right. It's where Master Hebea was born.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
If I'm not mistaken, I believe that his wife passed away a long time ago,

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
so it should be quite a peaceful arrangement.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Honestly, I'm relieved.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Up against him, even the most notable dignitaries won't make a fuss.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
He has wisdom and experience on his side,

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
and, well, you would know more about these matters than I could explain.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Proprietor, Madam, you have my thanks. I appreciate all that you've done.

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
In my years, I've never seen a courtesan like you before, Yugiiri.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
And I'm afraid we never will again.

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,000
To gain so much popularity, she could no longer get customers? Unheard of.

13
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
I'm sorry if I have caused you any trouble.

14
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
I wish you the best life.

15
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
But knowing you, I shouldn't have cause to worry.

16
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Oh my goodness, what have you girls been doing?

17
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Yugiiri, are you leaving us? Will we see you again? Is Saga really far away?

18
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Please don't go. I wanted you to teach me more about singing and dancing.

19
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:24,000
There, there, girls. She's a legendary courtesan who's starting a new life for herself.

20
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,000
You should be happy for her.

21
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Come now. Don't cry. Now. Let me see you smile.

22
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:38,000
I may be far away in Saga, but I promise that each of you will remain close to my heart.

23
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Well, technically, Saga doesn't actually exist anymore.

24
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Huh?

